    <item>
      <title>everyone can create live visuals</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/projects/teaching/ostrava-workshop25/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 12 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/projects/teaching/ostrava-workshop25/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I was invited by Dominika Goralska to give a workshop at the Ateliér of Koncept - objekt - instalace at the University of Ostrava. This was organised around the same time as &lt;a
  href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/posts/ostrava-solo/&#34;&gt;my solo exhibition&lt;/a&gt; at Galerie Provoz, which was curated by Dominika ⋆˙⟡♡&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Workshop description + requirements:
    &lt;div id=&#34;workshop-description--requirements&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#workshop-description--requirements&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are invited to join this workshop on creating live visuals that will focus on the accessibility of tools and the intention of storytelling. Followed by a presentation on my work and practise with live visuals, we will work together to make small experiments. So, bring yourselves, any found footage along with your phones and laptops (if possible).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
